        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "已 + predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "已 is a concise written form for an attained situation. It does not by itself locate every event in the past.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他已到北京。",
                "pinyin": "tā yǐ dào Běijīng 。",
                "meaning": "He has already arrived in Beijing.",
                "audio": "c32758c48072c14f4468fde42b2a49846257627bf85119910174b7dc7cc5fbf2"
              },
              {
                "text": "工作已完成。",
